    "body": "# Adnan Ahmad\n\nAdnan Ahmad is a scholar and co-author with [[Brian Whitworth]] of *The Social Design of Technical Systems: Building Technologies for Communities*. Together they developed a comprehensive framework for applying social and ethical requirements to the design of technology systems.\n\nAhmad's work contributes to the contemporary effort to ground technology design in social science, systems thinking, and ethical analysis. By co-authoring with Whitworth, Ahmad has been instrumental in translating the Tavistock Institute's socio-technical principles into a framework relevant for digital and online systems.\n\n## Related Concepts\n\n- [[Obsidian Remote Vault/wiki/concepts/Socio-Technical Design]] — the methodology he developed with Whitworth\n- [[Brian Whitworth]] — co-author and collaborator\n- [[Tavistock Institute]] — the intellectual tradition informing their work"
