    "body": "# BetaNYC\n\nNYC-based civic technology organization. Hosted the UnSchool of Data 2026 conference where [[Smol Gardens]] was introduced.\n\n## Events\n\n### UnSchool of Data 2026\n- **Date**: March 28, 2026\n- **Event**: Introduced [[Smol Gardens]] as part of Open Civic Tech initiative\n- **Format**: Conference/workshop series\n- **Documentation**: [SCRIBE Notes](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1lRBVKu8kXWQl9IHWeLzKCLjWPEZvszj9Zl11Jtfqn40/edit?tab=t.0)\n\n## Focus\n\nBetaNYC supports open [[Civic Tech]] initiatives and community-driven technology development in New York."
